2026-05-10 14:49:37,978 - INFO - 
2026-05-10 14:49:37,978 - INFO - 2. **Cost and Feasibility**: Large-scale UBI programs can be very costly. Smaller tests can help assess the financial feasibility and identify ways to optimize the program's design to maximize benefits while minimizing costs.
2026-05-10 14:49:37,979 - INFO - 
