2026-05-10 14:50:05,212 - INFO - However, it's important to note that the effectiveness and cost-efficiency of healthcare systems can vary significantly between countries and even within different regions of the same country. For example, some private healthcare systems in certain contexts can be highly efficient and cost-effective due to competition and innovation.
2026-05-10 14:50:05,212 - INFO - 
